      "writtenOn": "2019-09-30T19:22:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The thrust of this sentence is that the onAvailable() ceases to track or otherwise care about the previous onAvailable() network the moment this is invoked. If there\u0027s a way to emphasize that I think it would be good. See above comment to further clarify that this sentence only applies to requestNetwork() behavior.",
