        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-30T19:22:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "is onLost() called when a network is *expected* to be lost (but could somehow survive), or is it only called when a network is guaranteed to be lost (providing a grace period)? If it\u0027s \"expected\" then I\u0027d suggest clarifying.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3296,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 3296,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "09230250de3fda7a4caa362eb236a8331f7966ef",
